# classifier does not already cover?
#
# The English classifier is the Jigsaw model, which labels `threat` and
# `identity_hate` on its own. If the guard only fires where those two already
# fire, it is a second opinion costing a second per message. If it fires alone on
# sex crimes, minors and drug or weapon dealing, it is buying something the feed
# genuinely needs — and those are the categories that carry legal exposure for an
# application that puts strangers next to each other on a map.
#
